  "description": "This example shows the difference between using 3rd and 4th order Laplacian with respect to the  dispersion observed. WIthout the 4th order Laplacian checkbox on, the simulation demonstrates a large difference in propagation speed for different frequencies (higher frequency -> lower propagation speed). With 4th order Laplacian enabled, the propagation speeds are the same over the complete range."
